{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_vrtx_01Hk92QSnFZmWqidtAtbeKm9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done. Written and committed **`05-010-testing-strategies-for-non-deterministic-outputs.md`**.\n\n**Key content:**\n\n- **5-layer testing stack:**\n  1. **Structural property assertions** at T=0 — schema, length bounds, forbidden-phrase checks (fast, CI-safe, deterministic)\n  2. **Semantic cosine gating** (≥0.85 on `text-embedding-3-small`) — paraphrase variation lands 0.93–0.97; genuine regression drops to 0.60–0.75\n  3. **LLM-as-judge** (GPT-4o / Claude 3.5 Sonnet with rubric) — 100% of golden set nightly, 5–10% live sample; alert on >0.3 mean-score drop\n  4. **Golden dataset pass-rate gate** (≥95% on 100–500 curated triples) — blocks deploy on model/prompt changes; `promptfoo` / `deepeval` for CI harness\n  5. **Shadow/canary routing** — 5% traffic to new version, auto-rollback if thumbs-down rises >2pp or latency SLO breached\n\n- **Key tradeoff:** T=0 for CI determinism and speed vs. sampled T=0.7 (k=5 runs, majority-pass) for realistic variance — pattern: T=0 in CI, sampled monthly for robustness audit\n- **Cross-links:** Q8 (production hallucination measurement pipeline), Q17 (golden dataset curation), Q21 (canary/shadow deployment patterns)"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":88,"cache_read_input_tokens":67922,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":88,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"91303aee-8998-4eee-9198-fb92e0783c05","uuid":"012a0f76-46e8-40f6-b5e4-f7dd8d65fe6c"}
